▪️US decline is owed to 2 systemic problems "Project Meridian" neither acknowledges nor poses a solution to: the unsustainable and unnecessary nature of pursuing primacy in the first place, and the equally unsustainable nature of for-profit systems competing with purpose-driven peers like Russia alone, let alone China;

